{"id":281572709,"title":"6.Day6","summary":"1.使用CRA初始化项目环境","content":"<p><strong>1.使用CRA初始化项目环境</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060610785-2815ec22-69e0-4436-a0a7-56c07ab93e52.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060630111-8ea3421f-eb59-48ba-9c98-34e5b21b1c0e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060660630-fd271c85-8273-4c60-abc9-b4fbaa6d4ddc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.安装scss包</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060782185-f6acbd10-07b5-439b-9f02-5329866af1f2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060847491-1f5fc05b-7153-4be5-b4b6-2aca14e559f9.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060853073-8838fc4a-f2ab-43ba-8f4c-c44850022340.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060880898-d7439cf9-cc3a-4662-bb5b-0bc785482195.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>3.安装antDesign</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060926984-1fa97837-ef7c-4d16-b0e0-c96a3316b4b3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060986084-5816612d-0445-4bc9-96bf-145aaec06b38.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787060974525-ff62f99c-7c84-440c-97f5-4daf6ea916ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061043335-3cf081ab-dc43-4f17-a42e-0d2d339d6359.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061080682-75e0018d-755b-4a37-b065-7c0dd0cd9e52.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061091830-f63cdb36-a7c1-4178-a009-2ac0fd6d96ff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061122688-4b90647d-53cc-4617-9eba-27c2253c7f90.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>4.配置基础路由Router</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061171934-eb5bffe4-79ae-48a4-be5d-ba1e22e2caaf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061189183-4c9bc018-9d9e-4cc5-8397-be3d5874b926.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061295184-d99e65cf-90ba-4391-a818-61dd9e97e3f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061310437-c1ca7c76-597e-498a-957f-072b4d34bd14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061413336-bfb84e4a-ef3c-4ab8-bef8-cabe4ec6473b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>步骤4：<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061479817-91ee14c1-a18c-4baa-bd41-5eb3f23a1006.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061496865-98b66755-7a59-4867-b346-b5e20b507621.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>5.配置别名路径</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061565588-ed1e2a46-ea22-4c8b-a74e-2ee65b28bcd5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061615251-01335219-3288-4b2d-8d06-3e715ae80ffa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061629838-50ba7825-50b1-4e37-a785-b604dbd10ac8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>新创建一个文件，代码是来自官方文档的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061667547-d0e88625-9f13-4272-853b-80d37df1ae3b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061700191-09549e50-a23b-4ede-b044-f3673a0306a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>将这里原本的命令替换一下<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061721393-1dd3b24f-a486-469e-be21-6ec0eb9f981f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们重启一下我们的项目<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061741328-d24a4ec5-4cf0-4a18-a5e4-8b584ba6fce9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061769668-e29e3c3f-1e29-42e8-9227-f13c1bba5954.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>改为@之后依然是可以启动的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061800728-147dffb3-49d2-45a4-916d-5759b3cfe13b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061826050-16bcc6fc-86dc-40ae-a901-725dc587a4da.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>依然新创建文件，把文档代码贴过来<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061860523-0919e833-b283-4086-97a9-74b5c66d66c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>6.使用gitee管理项目</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061917511-4d796c88-07fe-44b1-b704-d21f101b717e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>新创建<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787061954498-dc945d85-6b91-450f-9042-dbfc38ed8d34.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>因为这个项目已经有了（看到分支了）<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787062008526-ea6d0b3b-275b-433b-8102-e8b864bd45af.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787062047913-08d4f0aa-9402-4971-a9f9-65bd5ff6f3b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>7.Axios请求头注入Token</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787145406786-3597f1d6-07d2-4ac1-9c2e-a736311e8901.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787145608840-69f14e2b-1c6b-4607-b86b-32d941ca68bf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们选择一个来做测试--layout<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787145885365-ba661758-f960-4782-815b-180205565798.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>8.根据Token控制路由跳转</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787146015651-9d8ec911-54d2-4f3b-aea5-63bd23c88322.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>以路由组件为参数</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787146182460-405097b4-0ddf-4222-84cc-4f5efcda9bb8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们来做一个测试</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787146229946-ba33b74b-58ff-45e2-92a3-9ea5f77f8c2a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>9.Layout--结构创建和样式reset</strong></p>\n<p><strong>10.Layout--二级路由配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148178173-ee9ecadf-ff00-430a-a246-50e9407c4ef3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148261153-d8c7eb24-03a0-43bf-b283-9d1c6b39603b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148408520-422f35b9-aab3-4db9-9981-95150b704244.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148427808-0d597509-fe59-47e6-8f9e-4970a7d44e85.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>配置二级路由<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148486643-a89118a7-edcb-4f26-a4ce-a7a558b80cad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148512503-8f4cdc4a-5864-4b5d-8859-9e76fc666147.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>11.Layout--点击菜单跳转路由</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148558359-ede14610-7e3f-4924-81b3-6f35a018117e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>12.Layout--根据当前路由路径高亮菜单</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148601691-6ee421bd-7c92-4d76-804f-c4eab9601bce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>13.Layout--展示个人信息</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148650603-480a1a1c-ee4d-4bb8-a5a5-7bbf5f76b63f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>14.Layout--退出登录实现</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148703935-f615c473-7624-4e63-a4a8-f3ef4e9bd1db.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>15.Layout--处理Token失效</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148769108-b2349332-3297-43d7-a1d0-096716c8d595.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>16.Home-Echarts基础图表渲染</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148869256-0b17b72b-01eb-4795-bc35-ef9a183ec67d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们用要先安装<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148891894-c3eb48aa-513b-425c-aab0-5ff5a66aa798.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>找到我们需要的图<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787148929680-e56ec0a4-a332-4abc-bc39-93ecfc8f25b1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149024334-6ca2e85a-1ff4-432b-8c4e-01c0a90093e2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149107695-d5263097-1dd7-4276-b94b-e9dc9b1a315c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样就用我们react去获取我们的DOM节点<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149352787-dc7442bb-d81f-43b4-8847-683eb503a5cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149404885-589dcca3-fcd8-4118-844b-c3d8710dee70.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149427684-738c8b43-6974-472d-ae4b-a1848f78c5c9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>17.Home-Echarts组件封装实现</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149507155-811f53ed-557a-4de9-af73-65cadeeb4e2c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149612141-097cbecd-8a45-4beb-b86a-fdab4745c19f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149626904-a54f5a7d-02b8-47a4-bc12-4a4d4a2dd6da.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的props参数为title</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149682712-97983a75-9eb3-4100-b423-75a633604588.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149743777-956c4579-0e92-4d97-a8b5-cda0c5a8d980.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149777828-934812b3-e3b0-4a66-942c-9d2e0cbb8805.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>18.扩展--api模块封装</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149849642-450a9511-9f4b-4c72-946f-5bbfe2911b57.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们用request导出数据，我们就要先把他导入进来</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787149890972-763ddc78-3b20-4584-bbb0-fdab8343e0b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150008444-5fcf0ad5-8945-43c3-88f3-816ad55553a8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150044665-f6fb9a3f-4a16-49a8-8530-20d009449fad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150106573-24c06af3-f789-4b58-9724-6931b98c22de.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id":82407692,"name":"React","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-16T16:19:11.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T14:35:45.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/rlg5dd/my86dimg3zoatbdw","slug":"my86dimg3zoatbdw","wordCount":328}